      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Confluence%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The borough sits at the southern end of Lower Turkeyfoot Township, with the borough of Ursina to its east.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
