      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Confluence%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Great Allegheny Passage bike trail passes through Confluence, part of a 335‑mile corridor from Pittsburgh to Washington, DC.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitconfluence.info/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Just south of town lies the 2,840‑acre Youghiogheny River Lake, a favorite for power‑boating.",
